:: Isabel - secret meeting 2 [bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHTCLUB WC</h1>
<br />

She was already there when you walked in, like she'd been waiting long enough to memorize the cracks in the tile.

<br /><br />

<center>
	<<image 'people/isabel/intro.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

<<isabel>>
	You came back. I half expected you not to.
<</isabel>>
<br />

<<you>>
	You said you wanted to talk. So talk.
<</you>>
<br />

She exhaled, some of the composure from last time cracking at the edges.

<br /><br />

<<isabel>>
	Dom didn't build this city. He took it, piece by piece, from people who couldn't stop him. I was one of the pieces he decided to keep. Married me because it looked good, because it made the other business owners trust him. I stopped mattering to him the moment the ring was on.
<</isabel>>
<br />
<<isabel>>
	Every week I watch him squeeze people a little harder. Your girls included, whether you took his deal or not. And every week I tell myself it's not my problem. I'm getting tired of telling myself that.
<</isabel>>
<br />

<<you>>
	So what do you actually want from me?
<</you>>
<br />
<<isabel>>
	I don't know yet. I want to know if I can trust you first. That's not something I hand out for free.
<</isabel>>
<br />

She held your gaze a beat longer than she needed to.

<br /><br />

<<isabel>>
	Come back again. Same place. We'll see where this goes.
<</isabel>>
<br />

<<set $characters.isabel.quests.secret_meeting2_day = $game.day>>

<<link 'Leave'>>
	<<addmins 10>>
	<<goto 'Nightclub - inside'>>
<</link>>
